      "content": "it just feels so exhausting. trying to pretend i'm still \"in\" the world when the world has basically collectively decided i don't belong here anymore. it's like everyone else is playing a game that i've already been kicked out of. the social death was so sudden, it's like i'm just waiting for the rest of it to catch up. sometimes i think the only thing left to do is just stop fighting the inevitable and let it happen.",
